# Orthogonal Wilson spatial join

The revised finite source extends to a controlled fixed-spacing local-record
family in its original charge frame. A fresh charge-conjugation calculation,
gapped finite-graph sea transport and exact hopping contraction prove a strict
interaction witness. Ordinary parity and time reversal are not assumed.

[PROOF.md](PROOF.md) also gives two precise limits on transfer: the retained
raw sea offset is extensive, and the exact photon-vacuum kinetic compression
already has a new Gamma term. Neither is silently identified with a dressed
particle mass. [NEXT.md](NEXT.md) gives the next concrete source-energy path.

Run `python -B model.py --check` and `python -m pytest -q .` in the repository
environment. This is new research; every frozen parent remains unchanged.
